c=$.c==="en"
b=c?"Lubricating":"Tra d\u1ea7u"
a=c?"Use silicone cube lube: a thick one for the core and springs, a thin one where the pieces rub.":"D\xf9ng d\u1ea7u silicone d\xe0nh cho cube: lo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1eb7c cho l\xf5i v\xe0 l\xf2 xo, lo\u1ea1i lo\xe3ng cho ch\u1ed7 c\xe1c m\u1ea3nh c\u1ecd v\xe0o nhau."
r=c?"A few drops are enough \u2013 too much makes the cube slow and sticky.":"Ch\u1ec9 v\xe0i gi\u1ecdt l\xe0 \u0111\u1ee7 \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u qu\xe1 cube s\u1ebd ch\u1eadm v\xe0 d\xednh."
q=c?"Don't use WD-40, cooking oil or machine oil: they can damage the plastic and collect dust.":"Kh\xf4ng d\xf9ng WD-40, d\u1ea7u \u0103n hay d\u1ea7u m\xe1y: c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\xe0m h\u1ecfng nh\u1ef1a v\xe0 b\xe1m b\u1ee5i."
a=A.a([a,r,q,c?"After lubing, turn a few hundred times so it spreads evenly.":"Tra xong xoay v\xe0i tr\u0103m l\u01b0\u1ee3t cho d\u1ea7u th\u1ea5m \u0111\u1ec1u."],s)
c=$.c==="en"
r=c?"Adjusting tension":"Ch\u1ec9nh \u0111\u1ed9 c\u0103ng"
q=c?"Many cubes adjust tension at the 6 centres (pop the cap off to turn the screw) or with a dial \u2013 it depends on the model.":"Nhi\u1ec1u cube ch\u1ec9nh \u0111\u1ed9 c\u0103ng \u1edf 6 t\xe2m (g\u1ee1 n\u1eafp t\xe2m \u0111\u1ec3 v\u1eb7n \u1ed1c) ho\u1eb7c b\u1eb1ng n\xfam v\u1eb7n \u2013 tu\u1ef3 m\u1eabu."
p=c?"Too tight: heavy turning. Too loose: wobbly and prone to popping.":"Ch\u1eb7t qu\xe1: xoay n\u1eb7ng tay. L\u1ecfng qu\xe1: l\u1eafc l\u01b0 v\xe0 d\u1ec5 b\u1eadt m\u1ea3nh."
q=A.a([q,p,c?"Adjust all 6 faces evenly, a little at a time, and test.":"Ch\u1ec9nh \u0111\u1ec1u c\u1ea3 6 m\u1eb7t, m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t ch\xfat r\u1ed3i th\u1eed l\u1ea1i."],s)
c=$.c==="en"
p=c?"When a piece pops":"B\u1ecb b\u1eadt m\u1ea3nh"
o=c?"Put it back so its colours match the centres as on a solved cube.":"L\u1eafp l\u1ea1i sao cho m\xe0u c\u1ee7a m\u1ea3nh kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi c\xe1c t\xe2m nh\u01b0 l\xfac cube \u0111\xe3 gi\u1ea3i."
n=c?"Don't force it in any way: a twisted corner or flipped edge makes the cube unsolvable \u2013 the Solver will point this out.":"\u0110\u1eebng l\u1eafp \u0111\u1ea1i: m\u1ed9t g\xf3c b\u1ecb xoay hay m\u1ed9t c\u1ea1nh b\u1ecb l\u1eadt s\u1ebd khi\u1ebfn cube kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i \u2013 m\u1ee5c Gi\u1ea3i gi\xfap s\u1ebd b\xe1o l\u1ed7i n\xe0y."
m=c?"Unsure? Take out a few more pieces and reassemble the cube solved.":"Kh\xf4ng ch\u1eafc? Th\xe1o th\xeam v\xe0i m\u1ea3nh r\u1ed3i l\u1eafp c\u1ea3 cube v\u1ec1 tr\u1ea1ng th\xe1i \u0111\xe3 gi\u1ea3i."
o=A.a([o,n,m,c?"If it pops often, tighten the tension a little.":"Hay b\u1eadt m\u1ea3nh th\xec v\u1eb7n ch\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ed9 c\u0103ng th\xeam m\u1ed9t ch\xfat."],s)
c=$.c==="en"
n=c?"Taking it apart":"Th\xe1o v\xe0 l\u1eafp cube"
m=c?"Turn the top layer 45\xb0 and gently lever an edge up with a finger \u2013 no metal tools that scratch the plastic.":"Xoay m\u1eb7t tr\xean 45\xb0, d\xf9ng ng\xf3n tay b\u1ea9y nh\u1eb9 m\u1ed9t c\u1ea1nh l\xean \u2013 kh\xf4ng d\xf9ng v\u1eadt kim lo\u1ea1i l\xe0m x\u01b0\u1edbc nh\u1ef1a."
m=A.a([m,c?"Reassemble from the bottom up; the last piece is usually an edge: turn the layer 45\xb0 and press it in.":"L\u1eafp l\u1ea1i t\u1eeb d\u01b0\u1edbi l\xean; m\u1ea3nh cu\u1ed1i th\u01b0\u1eddng l\xe0 m\u1ed9t c\u1ea1nh: xoay l\u1edbp 45\xb0 r\u1ed3i \u1ea5n v\xe0o."],s)
c=$.c==="en"
l=c?"Cleaning":"V\u1ec7 sinh"
k=c?"Wipe with a damp cloth. If it's very dirty, wash the pieces in warm soapy water and let them dry fully before reassembling.":"Lau b\u1eb1ng kh\u0103n \u1ea9m. B\u1ea9n nhi\u1ec1u th\xec th\xe1o m\u1ea3nh r\u1eeda n\u01b0\u1edbc \u1ea5m v\u1edbi ch\xfat x\xe0 ph\xf2ng, \u0111\u1ec3 kh\xf4 h\u1eb3n r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi l\u1eafp."
k=A.a([k,c?"Re-lube after washing.":"R\u1eeda xong ph\u1ea3i tra d\u1ea7u l\u1ea1i."],s)
c=$.c==="en"
j=c?"Safety":"An to\xe0n"
i=c?"Cubes have magnets and small parts: keep them away from small children \u2013 swallowed magnets are very dangerous.":"Cube c\xf3 nam ch\xe2m v\xe0 m\u1ea3nh nh\u1ecf: \u0111\u1ec3 xa t\u1ea7m tay tr\u1ebb nh\u1ecf \u2013 nu\u1ed1t ph\u1ea3i nam ch\xe2m r\u1ea5t nguy hi\u1ec3m."
h=c?"Don't leave the cube in a hot car or strong sun: the plastic can warp.":"Kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ec3 cube trong xe hay d\u01b0\u1edbi n\u1eafng g\u1eaft: nh\u1ef1a c\xf3 th\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn d\u1ea1ng."
i=A.a([i,h,c?"Rest if your wrists hurt; warm up gently before long sessions.":"\u0110au c\u1ed5 tay th\xec ngh\u1ec9; kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi luy\u1ec7n l\xe2u."],s)
