b=$.c==="en"
a=b?"Finger 6: Fewer regrips":"Ng\xf3n 6: B\u1edbt c\u1ea7m l\u1ea1i tay"
a0=b?"Every regrip costs time and breaks your flow \u2013 avoid them.":"M\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ed5i tay \u0111\u1ec1u t\u1ed1n th\u1eddi gian v\xe0 l\xe0m \u0111\u1ee9t nh\u1ecbp \u2013 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ed1i \u0111a."
a1=b?"Algorithms with only R and U: keep the same grip from start to finish.":"C\xf4ng th\u1ee9c ch\u1ec9 c\xf3 R v\xe0 U: gi\u1eef nguy\xean t\u01b0 th\u1ebf c\u1ea7m t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed1i."
a2=b?"When F or L comes up: plan which hand does it and set up during the previous move.":"G\u1eb7p F hay L: ngh\u0129 tr\u01b0\u1edbc tay n\xe0o l\xe0m, c\u1ea7m s\u1eb5n t\u1eeb b\u01b0\u1edbc tr\u01b0\u1edbc."
a1=A.a([a1,a2,b?"Practise slowly with the right fingers first, speed comes later.":"T\u1eadp ch\u1eadm cho \u0111\xfang tay tr\u01b0\u1edbc, nhanh sau."],s)
a2=A.a([B.P3],b8)
b=$.c==="en"
a3=b?"Finger 7: A daily routine":"Ng\xf3n 7: Luy\u1ec7n chu\u1ea9n m\u1ed7i ng\xe0y"
a4=b?"How to practise fingertricks so your hands learn them right and get faster without mistakes.":"C\xe1ch t\u1eadp fingertrick \u0111\u1ec3 tay nh\u1edb \u0111\xfang, nhanh d\u1ea7n m\xe0 kh\xf4ng sai."
a5=b?"One fixed fingering per algorithm: R with the right wrist, U with a right index flick, U' with the left index, D with the ring finger, M' with the left ring finger pushing up from the back. If the fingering keeps changing, your hands never learn it.":"M\u1ed7i c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t c\xe1ch b\u1ea5m c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh: R b\u1eb1ng c\u1ed5 tay ph\u1ea3i, U b\u1eb1ng ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf ph\u1ea3i g\u1ea9y, U' b\u1eb1ng ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf tr\xe1i, D b\u1eb1ng ng\xf3n \xe1p \xfat, M' b\u1eb1ng ng\xf3n \xe1p \xfat tr\xe1i \u0111\u1ea9y t\u1eeb m\u1eb7t sau l\xean. \u0110\u1ed5i c\xe1ch b\u1ea5m li\xean t\u1ee5c th\xec tay kh\xf4ng nh\u1edb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c."
a6=b?"Slow first, fast later: follow a metronome, one move per tick. Start at 60\u201390 beats per minute.":"Ch\u1eadm tr\u01b0\u1edbc, nhanh sau: theo m\xe1y \u0111\u1ebfm nh\u1ecbp, m\u1ed7i ti\u1ebfng t\xedch m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc. B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u 60\u201390 nh\u1ecbp/ph\xfat."
a7=b?"Only add 10 bpm after 3 clean runs in a row. If you stumble, slow down \u2013 fast mistakes just teach your hands the mistake.":"L\xe0m \u0111\xfang 3 l\u1ea7n li\u1ec1n kh\xf4ng v\u1ea5p m\u1edbi t\u0103ng 10 nh\u1ecbp. V\u1ea5p th\xec gi\u1ea3m l\u1ea1i \u2013 t\u1eadp sai nhanh ch\u1ec9 l\xe0m tay nh\u1edb c\xe1i sai."
a8=b?"Repeat until the cube comes back: Sexy move \xd76, Sune \xd76, T-perm \xd72, Ua-perm \xd73. Not back = a wrong move somewhere.":"L\u1eb7p t\u1edbi khi cube v\u1ec1 nh\u01b0 c\u0169: Sexy move 6 l\u1ea7n, Sune 6 l\u1ea7n, T-perm 2 l\u1ea7n, Ua-perm 3 l\u1ea7n. Kh\xf4ng v\u1ec1 nh\u01b0 c\u0169 = c\xf3 b\u01b0\u1edbc sai."
a9=b?"Hold lightly, relax your shoulders. 10\u201315 minutes a day beats an hour at the weekend.":"C\u1ea7m nh\u1eb9 tay, th\u1ea3 l\u1ecfng vai. M\u1ed7i ng\xe0y 10\u201315 ph\xfat hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n 1 ti\u1ebfng v\xe0o cu\u1ed1i tu\u1ea7n."
a5=A.a([a5,a6,a7,a8,a9,b?"Now and then film your hands: count the regrips and look for ways to remove them.":"Th\u1ec9nh tho\u1ea3ng quay video tay m\xecnh: \u0111\u1ebfm s\u1ed1 l\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i c\u1ea7m l\u1ea1i tay v\xe0 t\xecm c\xe1ch b\u1ecf b\u1edbt."],s)
a6=A.a([B.P2,B.Pa],b8)
b=$.c==="en"
a7=b?"Finger 8: Advanced technique":"Ng\xf3n 8: K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt n\xe2ng cao"
a8=b?"Habits of fast solvers: a solid home grip, the middle finger, pinches, two equally good hands and algorithms that suit you.":"Nh\u1eefng th\xf3i quen c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi gi\u1ea3i nhanh: c\u1ea7m chu\u1ea9n, d\xf9ng ng\xf3n gi\u1eefa, k\u1eb9p (pinch), hai tay \u0111\u1ec1u nhau v\xe0 c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c h\u1ee3p tay."
a9=b?"Home grip: both thumbs on the front, the other fingers behind, holding lightly with your fingertips. Return to it after every algorithm \u2013 every other fingertrick starts from here.":"T\u01b0 th\u1ebf c\u1ea7m chu\u1ea9n (home grip): ng\xf3n c\xe1i hai tay \u1edf m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc, c\xe1c ng\xf3n c\xf2n l\u1ea1i \xf4m ph\xeda sau, c\u1ea7m b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u1ea7u ng\xf3n v\xe0 th\u1eadt nh\u1eb9. Xong m\u1ed7i c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c th\xec tr\u1edf v\u1ec1 \u0111\xfang t\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\xe0y \u2013 m\u1ecdi c\xe1ch b\u1ea5m kh\xe1c \u0111\u1ec1u b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb \u0111\xe2y."
b0=b?"Middle finger: do U2 as a right index flick followed straight away by the right middle finger (a double flick), not two index flicks. Same for U' U' with the left index then middle. Treat R2 and D2 the same way: one continuous motion, no pause in the middle.":"Ng\xf3n gi\u1eefa: U2 l\xe0m b\u1eb1ng ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf ph\u1ea3i r\u1ed3i ng\xf3n gi\u1eefa ph\u1ea3i g\u1ea9y li\u1ec1n nhau (double flick), kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n hai l\u1ea7n tr\u1ecf. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 U' U' b\u1eb1ng tr\u1ecf tr\xe1i r\u1ed3i gi\u1eefa tr\xe1i. \u0110\xe2y c\u0169ng l\xe0 c\xe1ch l\xe0m R2, D2 nhanh: m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\xe1c li\u1ec1n, kh\xf4ng d\u1eebng gi\u1eefa."
b1=b?"Pinch: when your hand is off the home grip (right after R or F), the index finger turns U or F while the thumb holds the opposite side like a clip \u2013 you turn without regripping. Practise slowly at the exact spots in the algorithms you use.":"K\u1eb9p (pinch): khi tay \u0111ang l\u1ec7ch kh\u1ecfi t\u01b0 th\u1ebf chu\u1ea9n (ngay sau R ho\u1eb7c F), ng\xf3n tr\u1ecf k\xe9o m\u1eb7t U ho\u1eb7c m\u1eb7t F trong khi ng\xf3n c\xe1i gi\u1eef ph\xeda \u0111\u1ed1i di\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 c\xe1i k\u1eb9p \u2013 xoay \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\xe0 kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i c\u1ea7m l\u1ea1i tay. T\u1eadp ch\u1eadm t\u1eebng ch\u1ed7 trong c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c b\u1ea1n hay d\xf9ng."
b2=b?"Two equal hands: your left hand should manage L' U' L U and a left Sune too. Then left-slot F2L pairs go straight in without rotating the cube. Each session, train the weaker hand first.":"Hai tay \u0111\u1ec1u nhau: tay tr\xe1i c\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i l\xe0m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c L' U' L U, Sune tay tr\xe1i. Khi \u0111\xf3 c\u1eb7p F2L \u1edf khe tr\xe1i ch\xe8n lu\xf4n, kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n xoay c\u1ea3 cube. M\u1ed7i bu\u1ed5i t\u1eadp tay y\u1ebfu tr\u01b0\u1edbc, tay m\u1ea1nh sau."
b3=b?'Algorithms that suit you: one case can have several algorithms \u2013 pick the one that flows best for your hands (OLL/PLL library \u2192 "Your algorithm"), then keep one fixed fingering.':'C\xf4ng th\u1ee9c h\u1ee3p tay: c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\xf3 nhi\u1ec1u c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c \u2013 ch\u1ecdn c\xe1i b\u1ea1n l\xe0m m\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5t (th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n OLL/PLL \u2192 "C\xf4ng th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n"), r\u1ed3i gi\u1eef c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u1ed9t c\xe1ch b\u1ea5m.'
s=A.a([a9,b0,b1,b2,b3,b?"Priority: home grip and algorithm choice right away; two equal hands while learning F2L; middle-finger tricks and pinches once you're sub-30.":"Th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 \u01b0u ti\xean: c\u1ea7m chu\u1ea9n v\xe0 ch\u1ecdn c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c h\u1ee3p tay l\xe0m ngay; hai tay \u0111\u1ec1u nhau khi h\u1ecdc F2L; ng\xf3n gi\u1eefa v\xe0 k\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ec3 sau khi \u0111\xe3 gi\u1ea3i d\u01b0\u1edbi 30 gi\xe2y."],s)
b=$.c==="en"
