f5=f1?"L shape at front + right: f R U R' U' f' (f = turn the 2 front layers). L shape at back + left: F U R U' R' F'.":"Ch\u1eef L \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1edbc + ph\u1ea3i: f R U R' U' f' (f = xoay 2 l\u1edbp tr\u01b0\u1edbc). Ch\u1eef L \u1edf sau + tr\xe1i: F U R U' R' F'."
