f4=A.a([f4,f5,f6,f1?"Note: some sites show the L shape held at back-left for the f algorithm \u2013 the app verified it by simulation, follow the pictures in Lookup.":"L\u01b0u \xfd: m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 trang ghi ch\u1eef L c\u1ea7m \u1edf sau-tr\xe1i cho c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c f \u2014 app \u0111\xe3 ki\u1ec3m ch\u1ee9ng b\u1eb1ng m\xf4 ph\u1ecfng, h\xe3y l\xe0m theo h\xecnh trong Tra c\u1ee9u."],s)
