f5=$.c==="en"
f6=f5?"2-look OLL 2: Complete yellow face":"2-look OLL 2: K\xedn m\u1eb7t v\xe0ng"
f7=f5?"7 cases, one algorithm each \u2013 no repeating Sune.":"7 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p, m\u1ed7i tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p 1 c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c \u2014 kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n l\u1eb7p Sune."
f8=f5?"The 7 shapes: Sune, Anti-Sune, H, Pi, U, T, L.":"7 h\xecnh c\u1ea7n nh\u1edb: Sune, Anti-Sune, H, Pi, U, T, L."
f9=f5?'Count the yellow corners facing up: 1 corner \u2192 Sune or Anti-Sune; 0 corners \u2192 H or Pi; 2 corners \u2192 U, T or L (L is also called "bowtie" \u2013 2 diagonal corners).':'\u0110\u1ebfm s\u1ed1 g\xf3c v\xe0ng h\u01b0\u1edbng l\xean: 1 g\xf3c \u2192 Sune ho\u1eb7c Anti-Sune; 0 g\xf3c \u2192 H ho\u1eb7c Pi; 2 g\xf3c \u2192 U, T ho\u1eb7c L (L c\xf2n g\u1ecdi l\xe0 "n\u01a1" \u2013 2 g\xf3c ch\xe9o).'
g0=f5?"Turn U to match the picture in the Lookup tab (watch the yellow on the sides), then do the algorithm.":"Xoay U cho kh\u1edbp h\xecnh trong tab Tra c\u1ee9u (ch\xfa \xfd m\xe0u v\xe0ng \u1edf m\u1eb7t b\xean), r\u1ed3i l\xe0m c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c."
