g4=g3?"2-look PLL 2: Swap edges":"2-look PLL 2: \u0110\u1ed5i ch\u1ed7 c\u1ea1nh"
g5=g3?"Corners done: put the 4 edges in place \u2013 cube solved!":"G\xf3c \u0111\xe3 xong: \u0111\u01b0a 4 c\u1ea1nh v\u1ec1 \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7 \u2014 xong cube!"
g6=g3?"One side fully solved: put it at the BACK. Front middle sticker matches the RIGHT side \u2192 Ua-perm; matches the LEFT side \u2192 Ub-perm.":"C\xf3 1 m\u1eb7t \u0111\xfang h\u1ebft: \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1eb7t \u0111\xf3 \u1edf SAU. \xd4 gi\u1eefa m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\xf9ng m\xe0u m\u1eb7t PH\u1ea2I \u2192 Ua-perm; c\xf9ng m\xe0u m\u1eb7t TR\xc1I \u2192 Ub-perm."
g7=g3?"M versions (solved side still at the BACK): only M and U, no regrips \u2013 many find them faster once M feels natural.":"B\u1ea3n M (v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1eb7t \u0111\xfang \u1edf SAU): ch\u1ec9 d\xf9ng M v\xe0 U, kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ed5i tay \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ea5y nhanh h\u01a1n khi \u0111\xe3 quen M."
g8=g3?"No solved side, edges swap across \u2192 H-perm.":"Kh\xf4ng m\u1eb7t n\xe0o \u0111\xfang, c\xe1c c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ed5i ch\u1ed7 \u0111\u1ed1i di\u1ec7n \u2192 H-perm."
g9=g3?"No solved side, edges swap with neighbours \u2192 Z-perm (hold it so the swapped pairs are back-left and front-right).":"Kh\xf4ng m\u1eb7t n\xe0o \u0111\xfang, c\xe1c c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ed5i ch\u1ed7 k\u1ec1 nhau \u2192 Z-perm (c\u1ea7m sao cho c\u1eb7p \u0111\u1ed5i ch\u1ed7 \u1edf sau-tr\xe1i v\xe0 tr\u01b0\u1edbc-ph\u1ea3i)."
